# The runtime image builds from the checkout, as sharp/README.md shows. Its source stage copies the whole context into
# the image's source tarball, so this leaves out the checkout's own build output, which the image builds anew or never
# reads: git's folder, the lanes' worktrees, what sharp/bin builds in sharp/build, and the packages and compiled files
# the test fixtures install.
.git
worktrees
sharp/build
sharp/agents
**/.sharp
Zend/tests/sharp/vendor
sharp/mago/vendor
sharp/phpunit/vendor
sharp/hosts/vendor
